   "date": "2016-02-02",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The speaker supported the Migration Legislation Amendment (Cessation of Visa Labels) Bill 2015, which gives statutory effect to ending visa labels; monthly issuances dropped from about 100,000 in 2011 to 2,816 in August 2015, and industry stakeholders were consulted and supportive."
